{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40322","headline":"逢友人赴阙 · 卢延让","name":"逢友人赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正当天下待雍熙，丹诏徴来早爲迟。\n倚马才高犹爱艺，问牛心在肯容私。\n吏开黄阁排班处，民拥青门看入时。\n却笑郡人留不得，感恩唯拟立生祠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢延让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}